# Optional. A dedicated mainnet RPC endpoint used as the default in the UI.
# The public endpoints rate-limit hard and reject getProgramAccounts, so the
# mint scan only works with one of these.
#
# This value is compiled into the client bundle and is therefore PUBLIC.
# Restrict the key to your own domain in your RPC provider's dashboard, or put
# a method-whitelisting proxy in front of it. Never use an unrestricted key.
VITE_RPC_URL=https://your-endpoint.example.com/?api-key=domain-restricted-key
